{"title":"이세계 주점 노부","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=hVmbk/hzXapATe10/xiGixhuYF1oMciGvkMtRE0&filename=th3","synopsis":"고도(古都) 아이테리아의 뒷골목으로 이어진 일본식 주점 ‘노부’. \n게으름뱅이 위병, 제멋대로인 자작가문의 영애, 엄격한 징세청부인 등, 개성적인 이세계 주민들은 낯선 일본식 주점 요리에 입맛을 다시며, 차례차례 그 맛의 포로가 되어 가는데…?!\n오뎅, 닭튀김, 회덮밥―――― 노부 타이쇼, ‘일단 생맥’ 한잔! 이세계로 이어진 주점에서 벌어지는 미식 판타지, 마침내 개막!\n[ISEKAI IZAKAYA \"NOBU\"]ⓒ Virginia-Nitouhei 2015/KADOKAWA CORPORATION \nⓒ Natsuya Semikawa, Kururi/TAKARAJIMASHA","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":289,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":280,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":235,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":173,"change":{"type":"up","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":251,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":187,"change":{"type":"up","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":249,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":217,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":196,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":175,"change":{"type":"up","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":190,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":259,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-08","rank":272,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":250,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":240,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":261,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-13","r